{"seq":2,"slug":"fuel-residential-peak-surcharge","title":"燃油/住宅/旺季等附加费规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/contract-rate-management/fuel-residential-peak-surcharge","wordCount":1956,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"燃油-住宅-旺季等附加费规则\">燃油/住宅/旺季等附加费规则</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在费率库把附加费建成了对象之后，真正决定账单金额的是这些对象背后的<strong>计算公式与触发条件</strong>。附加费的种类看似杂乱，但按驱动因素可以归成三族：<strong>跟指数走的</strong>（燃油）、<strong>跟地址属性走的</strong>（住宅/偏远）、<strong>跟时间窗口走的</strong>（旺季/假日）。三族的计算结构完全不同，混在一起建模是账单争议的主要来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"燃油附加费-指数联动与滞后窗口\">燃油附加费：指数联动与滞后窗口</h2><p>燃油附加费（FSC / bunker surcharge）不是承运商随意定的数字，它是<strong>一个公开指数加上一个合同约定的换算规则</strong>。这个结构对采购方是有利的：指数公开可查，换算规则写在合同里，双方都无法单方面操纵。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指数选择\">指数选择</h3><p>海运常用的是燃料油价格指数，陆运与快递常用的是柴油零售价。美国柴油零售价有权威的公开发布渠道：EIA 的 Gasoline and Diesel Fuel Update 逐周发布全国与各 PADD 分区的柴油价格，并明确标注发布日与下次发布日（<a href=\"https://www.eia.gov/petroleum/gasdiesel/\">EIA Gasoline and Diesel Fuel Update</a>）。选指数时要注意三件事：<strong>发布频率</strong>（周度还是月度）、<strong>地理粒度</strong>（全国均价还是分区价）、<strong>是否含税</strong>（EIA 的报价含全部税费）。合同里必须把这三项都写死，否则&quot;指数涨了&quot;这个事实无法被验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"联动公式\">联动公式</h3><p>最通用的一档式联动是&quot;基准指数 + 斜率 × 指数变动&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FSC</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>base_fsc</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>slope</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>lag</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FSC}(t) = \\text{base\\_fsc} + \\text{slope} \\times \\big(I(t - \\text{lag}) - I_0\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FSC</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base_fsc</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slope</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lag</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是签约时的基准指数值，<code>slope</code> 是每单位指数变动对应的附加费变化，<code>lag</code> 是滞后天数或滞后周期数。三个参数都是谈判项。</p>\n<h3 id=\"滞后窗口为什么必须有\">滞后窗口为什么必须有</h3><p>没有滞后窗口的联动会把指数的高频噪声直接传导到每一张账单上，带来两个后果：账单金额逐日波动，结算与对账无法批量处理；且承运商可以在指数高点集中开票、在低点压单。滞后窗口（常见 30 天或一个自然月）把高频噪声滤掉，同时保留了燃料成本的主要变化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 燃油附加费重算：按运单接收日回溯滞后窗口内的指数&#10;SELECT s.shipment_id,&#10;       s.accepted_at,&#10;       idx.index_value,&#10;       r.base_fsc + r.slope * (idx.index_value - r.base_index_value) AS fsc_amount&#10;FROM shipment s&#10;JOIN fuel_index idx&#10;  ON idx.region_code = r.index_region&#10; AND idx.period_start = date_trunc(&#39;month&#39;, s.accepted_at - (r.lag_days || &#39; days&#39;)::interval)&#10;JOIN rate_fuel_rule r&#10;  ON r.carrier_id = s.carrier_id&#10; AND r.category_code = s.category_code&#10; AND s.accepted_at &gt;= r.effective_from&#10; AND s.accepted_at &lt;  COALESCE(r.effective_to, &#39;infinity&#39;::date);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 燃油附加费重算：按运单接收日回溯滞后窗口内的指数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">accepted_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       idx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">index_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">base_fsc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">slope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">idx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">index_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">base_index_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fsc_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fuel_index idx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">region_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">index_region</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period_start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">accepted_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lag_days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ' days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::interval)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rate_fuel_rule r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">accepted_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">accepted_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'infinity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>JOIN</code> 条件里的生效区间过滤：燃油规则本身也会按合同期更新，因此&quot;用哪一版公式&quot;和&quot;用哪个指数值&quot;是两个独立的版本判定，必须都带上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"附加上限与下限\">附加上限与下限</h3><p>成熟的合同会给 FSC 加<strong>封顶</strong>（cap）与<strong>保底</strong>（floor）。封顶保护采购方在油价暴涨时的成本，保底则让承运商在油价暴跌时不至于倒亏——保底条款通常换来更低的基价。两者都是价格，不是善意。</p>\n<h2 id=\"住宅与偏远派送-地址属性的判定\">住宅与偏远派送：地址属性的判定</h2><p>住宅派送附加费（residential delivery surcharge）的争议几乎全部集中在一点：<strong>这个地址到底算不算住宅</strong>。承运商有自己的地址分类库，采购方有自己的收货地址数据，两者不一致时谁说了算，必须在合同里写明。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定不能用-看起来像\">判定不能用&quot;看起来像&quot;</h3><p>不能靠&quot;门牌号里有没有 apt/unit&quot;这类字符串规则来判定，因为大量商业地址也带单元号，而大量住宅地址是独栋无单元号。可行的方法有两种：<strong>用承运商提供的地址分类接口/文件回传结果</strong>，或用第三方地址标准化服务给出住宅/商业标记。无论哪种，判定结果都要<strong>落库并带时间戳</strong>——判定是资产，不是运行时临时计算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>附加费</th>\n<th>判定依据</th>\n<th>判定来源</th>\n<th>争议举证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>住宅派送</td>\n<td>地址分类</td>\n<td>承运商分类库 / 第三方标准化</td>\n<td>分类结果快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏远地区</td>\n<td>邮编清单</td>\n<td>合同附件的 zone/邮编表</td>\n<td>清单生效版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周六派送</td>\n<td>派送日期</td>\n<td>轨迹里程碑</td>\n<td>派送签收时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超尺寸</td>\n<td>单边或围长</td>\n<td>包裹实测尺寸</td>\n<td>尺寸测量凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次派送</td>\n<td>派送失败次数</td>\n<td>轨迹异常码</td>\n<td>失败原因码与照片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"判定的边界-谁承担分类错误\">判定的边界：谁承担分类错误</h3><p>合同必须回答&quot;承运商把商业地址错判为住宅并加收，责任在谁&quot;。标准做法是把<strong>举证责任放在收费方</strong>：承运商需提供分类依据，否则该笔附加费不予支付。这个约定要在费率库里以 <code>evidence_required</code> 字段表达（见 <a href=\"contract-rate-library-accessorial\">合同费率库</a>），而不是靠事后协商。</p>\n<h2 id=\"旺季附加费-窗口-挂载与例外\">旺季附加费：窗口、挂载与例外</h2><p>旺季附加费（PSS）与前两族不同，它的驱动因素不是成本变化，而是<strong>供需关系</strong>。它按时间窗口整段上浮，因此规则设计的重点全在&quot;窗口怎么定义、加在什么单位上、谁被豁免&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"窗口定义的两种方式\">窗口定义的两种方式</h3><p><strong>固定日历窗口</strong>（如每年 8 月 1 日至 10 月 31 日）简单可预测，但对采购方不利——即使今年旺季不旺，附加费照收。<strong>触发式窗口</strong>（如某航线的舱位利用率或即期运价指数超过阈值后 T 天启用）更贴近真实供需，但需要双方认可一个可观测的触发指标。</p>\n<p>谈判中值得争取的是&quot;触发式 + 封顶天数&quot;的组合：只在真的紧张时收，且总收费天数有上限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"挂载单位决定了绝对金额\">挂载单位决定了绝对金额</h3><p>同一个 PSS 百分比挂在不同单位上，金额差异可能达到数倍：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PSS 金额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>rate</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>container</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>按箱</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>rate</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>TEU</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>按 TEU 折算</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>rate</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>计费重量</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>按重量</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PSS 金额} = \\begin{cases} \\text{rate} \\times n_{\\text{container}} &amp; \\text{按箱} \\\\ \\text{rate} \\times \\text{TEU} &amp; \\text{按 TEU 折算} \\\\ \\text{rate} \\times \\text{计费重量} &amp; \\text{按重量} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PSS </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">金额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">container</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TEU</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计费重量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">按箱</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">按</span><span class=\"mord\"> TEU </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">折算</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">按重量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>按箱挂载对轻货有利（一箱一价），按重量挂载对重货有利。采购方应根据自己的货型特征选择，而这一条恰恰经常在招标时被忽略——RFP 里只写&quot;PSS 按市场惯例&quot;，成交后才发现对自己最不利的那种挂载方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"例外清单-已承诺量豁免\">例外清单：已承诺量豁免</h3><p>PSS 谈判里价值最高的一条是<strong>例外清单</strong>：合同约定最低货量（MQC）以内的部分豁免 PSS，超出部分才收。这条把 PSS 的影响限制在&quot;额外增加的货量&quot;上，与长约的核心诉求（价格可预测）一致。MQC 本身是海运服务合同的必备条款之一，与线运费率、履约赔偿、有效期并列（<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-46/part-530\">46 CFR § 530.8</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[运单产生] --&gt; B{有 PSS 窗口?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| Z[不含 PSS]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C{货量在 MQC 内?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D{合同含豁免清单?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| Z&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[按挂载单位计 PSS]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E&#10;  E --&gt; F{超过封顶天数?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[仅计封顶内天数]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[全额计入]&#10;  G --&gt; I[写入账单比对基准]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[运单产生] --&gt; B{有 PSS 窗口?}\n  B --&gt;|否| Z[不含 PSS]\n  B --&gt;|是| C{货量在 MQC 内?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D{合同含豁免清单?}\n  D --&gt;|是| Z\n  D --&gt;|否| E[按挂载单位计 PSS]\n  C --&gt;|否| E\n  E --&gt; F{超过封顶天数?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[仅计封顶内天数]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[全额计入]\n  G --&gt; I[写入账单比对基准]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h3 id=\"假日与拥堵附加费\">假日与拥堵附加费</h3><p>同一族里还有假日操作附加费（holiday surcharge）与港口拥堵附加费（congestion surcharge）。两者都不改变计算结构，只是触发条件不同——前者按目的地法定假日日历，后者按港口作业状态。建模时应复用同一个&quot;窗口 + 挂载单位 + 例外清单&quot;规则模板，只换触发源，<strong>不要为每一种附加费写一套独立逻辑</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>燃油附加费 = 公开指数 + 合同换算规则（基准值、斜率、滞后窗口），三者都要写死；附加上下限是价格条款而非善意。</li>\n<li>指数选择要固定发布频率、地理粒度与含税口径（EIA 柴油报价含全部税费）。</li>\n<li>住宅/偏远附加费的争议核心是地址分类归属，判定结果必须落库；举证责任应放在收费方。</li>\n<li>旺季附加费的重点是窗口定义（固定 vs 触发）、挂载单位（箱/TEU/重量）与例外清单（MQC 内豁免）。</li>\n<li>假日与拥堵附加费复用同一规则模板，只替换触发源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"燃油/住宅/旺季等附加费规则","id":"燃油-住宅-旺季等附加费规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"燃油附加费：指数联动与滞后窗口","id":"燃油附加费-指数联动与滞后窗口"},{"level":3,"text":"指数选择","id":"指数选择"},{"level":3,"text":"联动公式","id":"联动公式"},{"level":3,"text":"滞后窗口为什么必须有","id":"滞后窗口为什么必须有"},{"level":3,"text":"附加上限与下限","id":"附加上限与下限"},{"level":2,"text":"住宅与偏远派送：地址属性的判定","id":"住宅与偏远派送-地址属性的判定"},{"level":3,"text":"判定不能用\"看起来像\"","id":"判定不能用-看起来像"},{"level":3,"text":"判定的边界：谁承担分类错误","id":"判定的边界-谁承担分类错误"},{"level":2,"text":"旺季附加费：窗口、挂载与例外","id":"旺季附加费-窗口-挂载与例外"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口定义的两种方式","id":"窗口定义的两种方式"},{"level":3,"text":"挂载单位决定了绝对金额","id":"挂载单位决定了绝对金额"},{"level":3,"text":"例外清单：已承诺量豁免","id":"例外清单-已承诺量豁免"},{"level":3,"text":"假日与拥堵附加费","id":"假日与拥堵附加费"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合同费率库（base/附加费/FSC/DIM 除数）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/contract-rate-management/contract-rate-library-accessorial"},"next":{"title":"合同 SLA/赔偿条款与费率生效版本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/contract-rate-management/agreement-sla-rate-version-effect"}}